# Overleaf auto-detects this file and uses it to drive latexmk.
# Nothing here is required of authors.
#
# It used to carry custom dependencies for glossaries, acronyms
# and nomenclature. Those packages were removed from the template
# as unused, so the extra build passes went with them: pdflatex
# plus biber is now the whole story, which latexmk handles on its
# own.
# ==============================================================

$pdf_mode = 1;
